# prompt: small sci-fi pistol zap, quick and thin
# tags: laser, pistol, zap, weapon
# "Small" is the high-pass, not the pitch. A sidearm and a cannon can start on
# the same note; what says sidearm is that there is nothing under 700 Hz to
# feel, so the shot lands entirely in the ear.
sound "laser pistol" 150ms laser
  zap: chirp saw ~2600Hz[1200..5000] -> 480Hz in 90ms >> hp ~700Hz[300..1600] | gain 0.5 decay 130ms
  tick: click 1ms >> bp ~4000Hz[2000..8000] Q3 | gain 0.22 attack 0ms decay 12ms
